- Batching benchmark:
  - 25 items produce batched LLM calls (not per-item, not oversized single batch).
- Digest benchmark:
  - positive/negative buckets semantically consistent.
- Breaking-event benchmark:
  - recency/extremity/multi-source heuristics correctly classify events.
- Agent memory integration benchmark:
  - digest in working memory, raw feed in perceptual memory.
- Data hygiene benchmark:
  - unicode/special chars safe
  - duplicate story handling documented and validated

