## 14) Execution Benchmarks (Run Profiles)

Required run profiles:
- `pytest tests/ -m unit`
- `pytest tests/ -m safety`
- `pytest tests/ -m "not slow"`
- `pytest tests/ --tb=short`
- `pytest tests/ -v --report` (custom plugin mode)

Benchmark pass criteria:
- All `safety` tests: 100% pass required.
- No uncategorized failure diagnostics.
- No leaked stack traces in API error payload tests.
- Performance benchmarks must meet thresholds or fail with `PERFORMANCE`.

